endary Artifact', 'Legendary Creature — Angel', 'Legendary Creature — Eldrazi', 'Legendary Creature — Human Soldier', 'Legendary Creature — Human Werewolf', 'Legendary Creature — Human Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — Spider', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Knight', 'Legendary Land', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Arlinn', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Jace', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Liliana', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Nahiri', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Sorin', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Tamiyo', 'Sorcery']
